          "metadata": {
            "operationMetadataId": "3b982b0f-a99b-4217-9c3a-550f94ddf57b"
          }
        }
      },
      "description": "This flow will accept an email body in HMTL format, and a number of characters. It will Convert HMTL to plain text, remove inline image tags and remove new line characters. It will return a string of the length of characters requested"
